# 💬 OPIc Expressions - Day 02

## Expression

I'm looking forward to it.

Meaning

기대하고 있어요.

---

## Examples

I'm looking forward to meeting you.

I'm looking forward to the weekend.

I'm looking forward to my vacation.

---

## Useful Alternatives

- I can't wait.
- I'm excited about it.
- Sounds great.
